<title>ISRAEL: Israel financial markets closed for 2-day holiday.</title>
<headline>Israel financial markets closed for 2-day holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's financial markets will be closed on Sunday in honour of Memorial Day and on Monday in observance of Independence Day. Trading will resume on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
